## COMPLETE FULL-STACK AI EVENT PLANNING, BOOKING AND MANAGEMENT PLATFORM

Build a complete, professional, modern and fully functional AI-powered event planning and reservation platform for H20 Event Location in Purmerend, Netherlands.

This is a complete software application, not just a landing page or a visual prototype.

The application must combine:
- AI-powered event planning.
- Intelligent room recommendations.
- Event configuration.
- Activity recommendations.
- Catering selection.
- Budget calculations.
- Event scheduling.
- Online reservations.
- Date and availability management.
- Secure online payments.
- Customer accounts.
- Administrator management.
- Booking calendars.
- H20 knowledge management.

IMPORTANT:
If an existing H20 AI Event Assistant project already exists, extend it rather than rebuilding it. Preserve all existing working features, data, design decisions and integrations.

The finished product must look and function like a premium commercial SaaS application.

